I’m dispatching a revised exfiltration route and updated intel on Vogel’s security protocols. Review them carefully. Remember the code phrase: “The swallow returns at dusk.” Use it only as a last resort to signal immediate extraction. 

Stay vigilant, Kepler. This operation is critical. The fate of several ongoing investigations rests on your success. 

Over and out.

- Nightingale Control.



